  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Voters in Mississippi chose a member of the United States Senate in an election held on November 3, 2026.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385729256:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "After more than a week of ballot counting, Colom was projected the winner on November 11.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385729256:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "On November 11, Colom was ahead by 4,585 votes in unofficial results, and news outlets projected him the winner, although the count had not yet been certified.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385729256:29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Across 35 Senate races this year, Democrats won 19, Republicans won 11, and 5 had not yet been called.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:the-senate-table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:31Z",
      "text": "Democratic gains were recorded in Iowa, North Carolina, Kansas, Maine, Mississippi, Ohio and Texas.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-ia",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-nc",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-ks",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-me",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-ms",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-oh-special",
        "elex:2026-united-states-senate-elections:senate-tx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:39Z",
      "text": "When the data was read, the race tables had not called any of the 36 governor's races.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-gubernatorial-elections:governors-table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:49Z",
      "text": "In the House, Democrats held 257 seats and Republicans 169, with 9 still to be called; a majority requires 218.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-house-of-representatives-elections:house-infobox"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:55Z",
      "text": "On the map, 51 districts changed party, and 35 were not yet called in the race tables.",
      "cites": [
        "elex:2026-united-states-house-of-representatives-elections:house-table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:01:03Z",
      "text": "On 11 November 2026, 65,024 people read the English Wikipedia article, about 52× the usual.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Mississippi:2026-11-11",
        "views:en:2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Mississippi:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:01:08Z",
      "text": "Normally, the article draws a median of 1,258 readers a day.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Mississippi:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:01:15Z",
